      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you need your hair washed, continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the decision branch and convergence, the condition, and its corresponding action. Modeling the condition redundantly as an action is a valid, behaviour-preserving match."
    },
